---
layout: default
title: "Blast Radius: The Podcast"
description: >-
  What today's tech news means for your architecture. Five to ten minutes. No
  hype.
---

<header class="podcast-hero">
  <img
    src="<%= relative_url '/images/blastradius-cover.png' %>"
    width="600"
    height="600"
    alt="Blast Radius podcast cover art"
    class="podcast-show-art"
  />
  <h1>Blast Radius: The Podcast</h1>
  <p class="podcast-tagline">What today's tech news means for your architecture.</p>
  <div class="podcast-pitch podcast-pitch-long">
    <p>Something big happened in tech today. An outage, an acquisition, a security hole, a new regulation.</p>
    <p>So what does it mean for the systems you build? And for your career?</p>
    <p>Blast Radius is a short, fast take on the news that matters to software architects and senior developers. Each episode takes one story and looks at what it changes: how you design, run, buy, or staff your systems.</p>
    <p>Five to ten minutes. No hype. Just what it means for you.</p>
    <p>From Lee Atchison and Software Architecture Insights.</p>
  </div>

  <%
    # RSS only for now. Apple, Spotify and Overcast links wait for Lee's go to
    # submit the show. To add one, add a line here: ["Apple Podcasts", "https://..."].
    subscribe_links = [
      ["RSS", site.metadata.blastradius_rss_url],
    ].select { |_label, url| url.to_s != "" }
  %>
  <ul class="podcast-subscribe-buttons">
    <% subscribe_links.each do |label, url| %>
      <li><a href="<%= url %>" class="podcast-subscribe-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= label %></a></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
</header>

<section class="podcast-player">
  <% if site.metadata.blastradius_player_embed.to_s != "" %>
    <%== site.metadata.blastradius_player_embed %>
  <% else %>
    <%# PLAYER SLOT: paste Captivate's Show Player (Static Embed) code into blastradius_player_embed in src/_data/site_metadata.yml. %>
    <p class="podcast-player-pending">(Show Player not yet configured: see blastradius_player_embed in site_metadata.yml)</p>
  <% end %>
</section>

<section class="podcast-subscribe">
  <div class="podcast-subscribe-inner">
    <%= render "kit_form", uid: site.metadata.kit_inline_form_uid %>
  </div>
</section>

<p class="podcast-crosslink">For the long-form show, see the <a href="<%= relative_url '/podcast/' %>">Software Architecture Insights podcast</a>.</p>
